mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>The course aims at cultivating students' skills of acquiring medical information resourses efficiently, enabling them to master the methods of retrieving, managing, analyzing and screening information, use GenAI tools correctly and appropriately, and thus improving their information and academic literacy. It covers research topic selection, literature retrieval and management, information screening and analyzing from the perspective of academic exploration. It helps students command the path of scientific research inheritance and innovation, and prepares students for academic research and solving clinical problems.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
